WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Sunlight breaks the surface of a clear sea.

2
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:12.000
A school of fish turns in one motion.

3
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:20.000
A sea turtle glides over the reef.

4
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:28.500
Waves roll, then pull back across the sand.

5
00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:36.000
Dolphins cut the water beside the boat wake.

6
00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:47.000
The camera lifts — an open horizon, no land in sight.
